<title>GREECE: Greece to issue T-bills, 2-yr T-notes Feb 28.</title>
<headline>Greece to issue T-bills, 2-yr T-notes Feb 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece will issue 12-month T-bills and two-year zero-coupon T-notes on February 28, the finance ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates on the T-bills and T-notes will be announced at a later date, the ministry said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
